# The graphics console with the boot logo: VBE 800x600 with 256 colours, set by linuxstart (linuxstart-fb.patch) and
# drawn by vesafb (sysfb, which FB_VESA turns on, makes its device), the 224-colour penguin. The console scrolls by
# panning (the legacy acceleration code, and vesafb moving the display start with the Bochs VBE interface's Y offset:
# patches/0003), drawing only the new line, not every character on the screen.
CONFIG_FB=y
CONFIG_FB_VESA=y
CONFIG_FRAMEBUFFER_CONSOLE=y
CONFIG_LOGO=y
CONFIG_LOGO_LINUX_VGA16=n
CONFIG_LOGO_LINUX_MONO=n
CONFIG_LOGO_LINUX_CLUT224=y
CONFIG_FRAMEBUFFER_CONSOLE_LEGACY_ACCELERATION=y
